WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,120
Zhang Daolian

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,650
What does this mental illness in your ancestral family mean?

3
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:05,650
Even though my son was injured, he didn’t do anything.

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,610
Is the explanation still unclear?

5
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,970
Give your son more opportunities to express himself

6
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:11,770
Who knew he was useless?

7
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,390
OK OK

8
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:14,990
Isn't that what you are doing to deceive people?

9
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:17,110
We just tricked you, what can you do?

10
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:18,110
You hit me

11
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,910
You can't beat me either

12
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,460
Even your son can't beat Chen Ji

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:27,400
Why are these competitions so chaotic?

14
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,120
I feel like my head is getting bigger

15
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,470
Everyone dislikes him

16
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:34,480
No one can kill him, I tell you.

17
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,200
If my son is cheated by him,

18
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,360
I will never be done with you

19
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,000
I put you in the ground last night

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,720
Being a human being is not enough

21
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:42,840
Stop arguing

22
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:43,920
You should still worry about it

23
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,400
Live or die for them
